  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wack Ngouna Millet Processing and Marketing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector : Agriculture/ Millet production.Members : 2666 producers (females 218).Description : With an annual production of more than 3,000 tons of millet, the Wack Ngouna Producers&apos; Network wants to strengthen production and especially marketing by improving the conditions for processing and storing millet. The network wants to purchase a semi-industrial unit for processing, cleaning and bagging millet for sale. .The objective is to have a millet of superior quality, which can be marketed at the best price in Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
